OL,3,GNEWSAPower being restored as region
OL,4,Arecovers from storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPower has been restored to thousands of
OL,7,Fhomes across Yorkshire after disruption
OL,8,Fto the network was caused by Storm
OL,9,FBoelo over the weekend.
OL,11,FNormal service has also resumed at
OL,12,FLeeds Bradford Airport (LBA) after
OL,13,Fseveral flights were cancelled on
OL,14,FSunday, although some disruption
OL,15,Fcontinues on railways in the storm's
OL,16,Faftermath.
OL,18,FAbout 127,000 customers had lost power
OL,19,Fover the weekend across the north of
OL,20,FEngland, but supply had been restored
OL,21,Fto most of them on Sunday night,
OL,22,Faccording to Northern Powergrid.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
